Only Exclusive License can be Negotiated.

### **You can turn on the Negotiation by either applying the Global Rule or the Local Rule**

-   **Global Rule** helps you to turn on the negotiation on all the beats (except the ones having local rule.)
-   **Local Rule** helps you to to turn on the negotiation on a specific beat

**Tip**: Local rule is prioritized over the Global rule.

### **How to enable the Global rule?**

Turn it ON for all from **Studio Settings > Studio Controls**

![Turn it ON for all from Studio Settings Studio Controls](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-214306.png)

### **How to enable the Local Rule?**

**1) While Uploading**: Turn on the button "Is it negotiable?"

![1) While Uploading: Turn on the button "Is it negotiable?"](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-211956.png)

**2) After Uploading:**

-   Go to **My Beats**

![Go to My Beats](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-212015.png)

-   Click the icon on any exclusive beat *Note: The Negotiation feature can only be enabled if the Exclusive License option is turned on for the beat.*

![Click the icon on any exclusive beat Note: The Negotiation feature can only be enabled if the Exclusive](/images/2025/06/Screenshot-2025-06-30-212042.png)
